  "id": "photism",
  "term": "photism",
  "definition": "Photism is a colour sensation that is regularly experienced along with a sound, such as a musical note, voice, or word. In this historical usage, the colour may seem located where the sound is heard and usually changes or ends as the sound changes or stops.",
